          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since a new substance, carbon dioxide, is formed in this reaction, we say that a chemical change has occurred here as well. It can be represented as—"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
